      <title>Superspreading droplets for scalable and green perovskite photovoltaics</title>
      <link>https://www.nature.com/articles/s41893-026-01991-9</link>
      <content:encoded>
                &lt;p&gt;Nature Sustainability, Published online: 25 November 2026; &lt;a href="https://www.nature.com/articles/s41893-026-01991-9"&gt;doi:10.1038/s41893-026-01991-9&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Scaling up the manufacturing of perovskite solar cells requires rapid, zero-waste film deposition. The authors design a universal ink that accelerates production 30-fold, achieving high efficiencies.</content:encoded>
